URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/there-is-a-ladder-nine-movement-coll
 ective-2/
SUMMARY:There is a Ladder (Nine Movement Collective)
DESCRIPTION:There Is a Ladder is an interdisciplinary performance experienc
 e that pulls history forward while reimagining Black womanhood through cho
 reography\, video\, photography\, and sound.\nDirected by Chania Wilson\, 
 the work centers Black women’s embodied knowledge as a living archive\, 
 where movement becomes a way of remembering\, reframing\, and imagining fu
 tures. Through tightly composed choreography and layered media\, There Is 
 a Ladder explores lineage\, inheritance\, and the quiet labor of becoming.
 \n\nJanuary 16\, 7:30 pm-8:30 pm\n\nTickets: “Pay what you can” ($25 s
 uggested donation)\n\nMore Information + Tickets
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/01/ATC-Tab-Placeholder-Live-at-Bay-7-logo.png
