 aneri/
SUMMARY:Transylvanian Dance (Lucian Ban & Mat Maneri)
DESCRIPTION:Drawing on material from their albums Transylvanian Dance and T
 ransylvanian Folk Songs\, Lucian Ban and Mat Maneri present an evening of 
 work based on Béla Bartók’s field recordings in Transylvania at the be
 ginning of 20th century. Featuring video projections of rare archival vide
 os &amp\; photographs that Bartók himself took in his research trips (cou
 rtesy of Bartók Archives in Budapest)\, along with audio from the origina
 l wax cylinder recordings.\n\nMarch 3\, 7:30 pm-9 pm\n\nMore Information +
  Tickets\n\n&nbsp\;
