SUMMARY:World Cup Watch Party @ATC Lawn
DESCRIPTION:Soccer.com and Adidas are hosting an official FIFA watch party 
 for the U.S. Men's National Team's match against Paraguay in Group D of th
 e round-robin stage. It's a free event open to the public\, and all ages a
 re welcome. There will be lots of cool soccer merch for sale. We'll have l
 ive music starting at 6pm that night before kickoff at 9pm. So we encourag
 e you to come early to set up your blanket/chairs and enjoy some food and 
 beverages for sale from ATC restaurants. Remember to wear denim for the U.
 S.A. and enjoy World Cup action under the stars!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/05/adidas-SOCCERDOTCOM-USA_vs_Parguay-Social-1x1-1.jpg
