 -underground/
SUMMARY:Synthesize Juneteenth Event @AU
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, June 18\, 5-8pm\nJoin Code the Dream and the Ameri
 can Underground for an in-person Juneteenth celebration honoring innovatio
 n and the power of community. This special event will feature an engaging 
 panel discussion that will explore how nonprofits\, entrepreneurs\, and te
 chnologists are strengthening communities and expanding access to economic
  and digital opportunity\nCome connect\, share\, and celebrate as we honor
  Juneteenth’s legacy and our community’s commitment to building a more
  just and inclusive future.\nRegister for the free event here.
