URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/world-cup-watch-party-dbap/
SUMMARY:World Cup Watch Party | DBAP
DESCRIPTION:Join other fans at the DBAP for a FREE FIFA World Cup 26™ Wat
 ch Party in partnership with Lenovo as Team USA takes on Belgium in the Ro
 und of 16. Watch the USMNT on the biggest stage on Durham's biggest video 
 screen with full stadium sound in what is sure to be an unforgettable nigh
 t.\nGates open 6:30pm\; kickoff is 8:00pm. Bring a blanket to sit on the o
 utfield grass (no chairs allowed on grass)\, or sit in the stands. No outs
 ide food or beverages\, but both will be for sale in the stadium. Water bo
