SUMMARY:Ask Us About AI Agents | An Open\, Interactive Conversation
DESCRIPTION:Everyone's talking about AI agents. Far fewer can tell you what
  they are\, what they're good for\, and where they fall short.\n\nMark Hin
 kle and Don Shin are opening the floor for an honest conversation about 
 agents and answering whatever you bring. No slides. No vendor pitch. No re
 hearsed demo. Just direct access to people who work with this technology e
 very day and will talk straight about it.\n\nThis is a free event\, open t
 o the public\, but space is limited. So if you're a tech or business leade
 r\, a builder/architect/operator\, on a product/data/platform team or are 
 just serious about using AI responsibly and effectively\, sign up here.
