BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:American Tobacco Campus
UID:1231@americantobacco.co
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260821T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260821T190000
DTSTAMP:20260716T152540Z
URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/hasan-hates-ronny-ronny-hates-hasan/
SUMMARY:Hasan Hates Ronny | Ronny Hates Hasan
DESCRIPTION:During these divided times\, many people believe that open dial
 ogue and discourse are the only tools to mend a wounded nation. Comedians 
 Hasan Minhaj and Ronny Chieng believe the opposite: Hatred is the answer.\
 n\nThis is not one of those tours where two friends co-headline a show so 
 they can go on vacation together. Ronny and Hasan despise one another. And
  for one night only\, in 19 cities\, they will air their grievances -onsta
 ge\, at the same time – about America\, each other\, and each other’s
  entire family trees - for a paying audience.\n\nThe format? A DEBATE TO 
 THE DEATH. Imagine CNN’s Presidential Townhall that’s somehow more d
 emented and with less decorum. This will be a race to the bottom.\n\nMinha
 j and Chieng will face off about America’s most urgent issues: President
 s\, War\, the Economy\, Immigration\, Infrastructure\, Food\, Dating\, Fam
 ily Values\, and of course\, the impending Race War. This is not a call fo
 r peace. It’s a call for pettiness. Are you in? Get your tickets here.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/07/hasan-ronny.png
CATEGORIES:Performances
LOCATION:Durham Performing Arts Center (DPAC)\, 123 Vivian Street / William
  V. "Bill" Bell Way\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
