URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/ira-glass-stories-for-a-saturday-nig
 ht/
SUMMARY:Ira Glass | Stories For A Saturday Night
DESCRIPTION:\n\nAs part of WUNC's 50th Anniversary Celebration\, the host o
 f This American Life will bring a night of storytelling in the style he pi
 oneered on his hit radio show: funny stories with feelings. His program is
  heard each week by over three million listeners and has won the highest h
 onors in broadcasting\, including three Emmys (for a TV adaptation)\, eigh
 t Peabody Awards and the first Pulitzer Prize ever given to a radio show o
 r podcast. For decades\, it’s been one of the most popular podcasts in t
 he world. Glass invented a way to tell radio stories that reshaped audio s
 torytelling and has been widely imitated. Whether you’re a longtime fan 
 of the show or discovering his work for the first time\, you’re in for a
 n evening of funny and moving stories about people who may as well be your
  neighbors\, your friends\, or you.\n\n\nClick here for tickets and more i
 nformation.\n\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/07/Ira-Glass.jpeg
