X-SOURCE:American Tobacco Campus
UID:1237@americantobacco.co
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260917T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260917T193000
DTSTAMP:20260716T183835Z
URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/little-feat-the-last-farewell-tour/
SUMMARY:Little Feat | The Last Farewell Tour
DESCRIPTION:Playing is the joy and satisfaction of touring\, but it comes w
 ith the hard part -- travel\, the endless miles on a bus. There’s no dod
 ging the wear and tear\, and Little Feat has been playing for quite a whil
 e.\n\nWith tongue stuck somewhat in cheek\, Little Feat announces “The L
 ast Farewell Tour\,” which began April 2026.\n\nIt’s deﬁnitely not a
 n absolute\, never-gonna-play-again statement. This wind-down will take se
 veral years to accomplish\, and while it does\, Feat will continue to perf
 orm and record as long as they are able. It’s a retirement from the trav
 el of touring.\n\nAt the DPAC\, in partnership with Lincoln Theater. For t
 icket purchasing and other information\, visit the DPAC website.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/07/Little-Feat.jpeg
CATEGORIES:Concert,Live Music,Performances
LOCATION:Durham Performing Arts Center (DPAC)\, 123 Vivian Street / William
  V. "Bill" Bell Way\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
