SUMMARY:Good Moon Festival @DPAC
DESCRIPTION:Good Moon 2026 will be anchored by three nights of music at DPA
 C.\n\nOctober 8: Sylvan Esso with Meshell Ndegeocello\n\nOctober 9: Tyler 
 Childers with aja monet\n\nOctober 10: Sylvan Esso with Silvana Estrada\n\
 nThere also will be a free outdoor day concert at the American Tobacco Law
 n on October 10 featuring MJ Lenderman\n\nFollowing the sets at DPAC\, we 
 invite everyone to join us for more shows and afterparties at The Pinhook\
 , Boom Club\, and Bay 7.
