URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/maybe-happy-ending-broadway-dpac-202
 6-10-13/
SUMMARY:Maybe Happy Ending | Broadway @DPAC
DESCRIPTION:Winner of 6 Tony Awards\, including Best Musical\, MAYBE HAPPY
  ENDING tells the deeply human story of a chance encounter that sparks co
 nnection\, adventure\, and maybe even love. Helmed by Tony Award-winning d
 irector Michael Arden (Parade)\, MAYBE HAPPY ENDING has been called “o
 ne of the best musicals in years” (USA Today) and even “The best music
