SUMMARY:Bull City Race Fest + Expo
DESCRIPTION:Join thousands of other runners for a full race weekend in the 
 Bull City. The Bull City Race Fest Expo kicks things off at 8am Saturday\,
  October 17\, at the Patio at American Tobacco Campus. Then the half marat
 hon (7:25am start) and 5K (7:40am start) both start and end on Blackwell S
 treet on Sunday\, October 18\, followed by a party that wraps up at noon. 
 It's a fun way to connect with the local running community and see Downtow
 n Durham neighborhoods from a different perspective. Sign up here!
