URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/mrs-doubtfire-broadway-dpac-2026-10-
 30/
SUMMARY:Mrs. Doubtfire | Broadway @DPAC
DESCRIPTION:Everyone’s favorite Scottish nanny is headed to the Triangle
  in this internationally acclaimed hit musical critics call “wonderful\
 , heart-warming\, and laugh-out-loud funny” (Manchester Evening News) an
 d “a feel-good\, family-friendly comedy that delivers” (The Hollywood
  Reporter). Based on the beloved film\, MRS. DOUBTFIRE tells the hyster
 ical and heartfelt story of an out-of-work actor who will do anything for 
 his kids. It’s “the lovable\, big-hearted musical comedy we need righ
 t now\,” raves the Chicago Tribune – one that proves we’re better 
 together.\n\nCheck the DPAC website to learn more about this three-day run
  (including additional matinee performances Saturday and Sunday) and to pu
 rchase tickets. Note that showtimes vary.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/07/Mrs-Doubtfire.png
CATEGORIES:Performances
END:VEVENT
